---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Despre pantaloni cu snur lung | Moda urbana hub';
const description = 'Despre PantaloniCuSnurLung.ro, site informativ despre pantaloni cu snur lung, operat de SC ATELIER AXD SRL.';
const canonical = 'https://pantalonicusnurlung.ro/despre/';
const image = '/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg';
const schema = { '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'WebPage', name:title, url:canonical, image:new URL(image, canonical).href };
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} image={image} type="website" schema={schema}>
<section id="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="container"><div class="hero-inner-wrapper"><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-badge">Ghid urban 2026</div><h1 class="hero-h1">Despre<br/><span class="line2">PantaloniCuSnurLung.ro</span></h1><p class="hero-sub">Un hub dedicat unei piese simple, dar cu impact vizual: pantaloni negri, croiala relaxata si snur lung alb.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">Vezi colectia</a><a href="/ghid-marimi-pantaloni-cu-snur" class="btn-ghost">Ghid marimi</a></div></div></div><div class="hero-stats"><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">100<span>%</span></div><div class="stat-label">Calitate superioara</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Unisex</div><div class="stat-label">Purtat si de femei</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">1-3<span>zile</span></div><div class="stat-label">Timp livrare</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Card</div><div class="stat-label">sau ramburs</div></div></div></div></section><section class="owner-section" id="despre"><div class="container reveal"><div class="owner-grid"><img src="/pantaloni-barbati-negri-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni cu snur lung purtati in stil moda urbana" title="Pantaloni cu snur lung moda urbana" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="owner-img" /><div class="owner-text"><span class="section-tag">// Povestea magazinului</span><h2 class="section-h2" style="margin-bottom:20px">Pasiune pentru <em>Moda urbana</em></h2><p>La PantaloniCuSnurLung.ro strangem intr-un singur loc informatia si directia vizuala pentru pantalonii cu snur lung. Site-ul functioneaza ca hub dedicat, iar achizitia se face prin AtelierAXD.</p><p>Modelul cu snur lung este ales pentru impact vizual, confort si felul in care se aseaza in tinute urbane. Croiala poate fi loose, oversized, slim sau scurta, dar ideea ramane aceeasi: o piesa simpla, neagra, usor de purtat.</p><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="split-grid"><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Rolul site-ului</h2><p>Site-ul organizeaza informatia SEO si vizuala despre pantaloni cu snur lung.</p></article><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Rolul AtelierAXD</h2><p>AtelierAXD sustine zona comerciala, comenzile si colectiile disponibile.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="content-panel reveal" style="text-align:center"><span class="section-tag">// cumpara acum</span><h2 class="section-h2" style="margin:0 auto 18px">Pantaloni cu snur lung AtelierAXD</h2><p style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 26px">Daca ai ales stilul, mergi direct in magazin pentru modele disponibile, plata si livrare.</p><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd</a></div></div></section></Layout>
